      "text": "## Fisher's Runaway and the Good Genes Hypothesis"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-SEXUAL-SELECTION.md#012",
      "path": [
        "07-SEXUAL-SELECTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
