      },
      "text": "```\n  SPERM COMPETITION ADAPTATIONS:\n  ───────────────────────────────\n  Testis size: larger testes → more sperm → advantage in sperm competition\n               Chimpanzees (highly promiscuous): huge testes\n               Gorillas (single dominant male): small testes\n               Humans: intermediate (moderate sperm competition)"
    },
